| Token                     | Hex       | Role on the official site              |
| ------------------------- | --------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `--color-gf-orange`       | `#FF7321` | core / home tier accent                |
| `--color-gf-magenta`      | `#FF72FC` | edge tier accent                       |
| `--color-gf-green-bright` | `#00D699` | vivid accent                           |
| `--color-gf-line`         | `#DADCE0` | Google border grey (replaced #E2E2E2)  |
